  "content": "<p> All recorded lectures, except Special Lecture: Aerobatics, are listed below.</p>\n<div class=\"mb-2 border-gray rounded video-gallery-card\">\n  <a class=\"video-link\" href=\"../../resources/lecture-1-introduction/index.html\">\n    <div class=\"inner-container\">\n      <div class=\"left-col\"><img class=\"thumbnail\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/jeI3wpulyPw/default.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"right-col\">\n        <h5 class=\"video-title\">Lecture 1: Introduction to Private Pilot Ground School</h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-2 border-gray rounded video-gallery-card\">\n  <a class=\"video-link\" href=\"../../resources/lecture-2-airplane-aerodynamics/index.html\">\n    <div class=\"inner-container\">\n      <div class=\"left-col\"><img class=\"thumbnail\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/edLnZgF9mUg/default.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"right-col\">\n        <h5 class=\"video-title\">Lecture 2: Airplane Aerodynamics</h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-2 border-gray rounded video-gallery-card\">\n  <a class=\"video-link\" href=\"../../resources/lecture-3-learning-to-fly/index.html\">\n    <div class=\"inner-container\">\n      <div class=\"left-col\"><img class=\"thumbnail\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/PHtPau1c5sU/default.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"right-col\">\n        <h5 class=\"video-title\">Lecture 3: Learning to Fly</h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-2 border-gray rounded video-gallery-card\">\n  <a class=\"video-link\" href=\"../../resources/lecture-4-aircraft-systems/index.html\">\n    <div class=\"inner-container\">\n      <div class=\"left-col\"><img class=\"thumbnail\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/AYF3spOVbBk/default.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"right-col\">\n        <h5 class=\"video-title\">Lecture 4: Aircraft Systems</h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-2 border-gray rounded video-gallery-card\">\n  <a class=\"video-link\" href=\"../../resources/special-lecture-oshkosh-2018/index.html\">\n    <div class=\"inner-container\">\n      <div class=\"left-col\"><img class=\"thumbnail\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/s67DO7fFM14/default.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"right-col\">\n        <h5 class=\"video-title\">Special Lecture: Oshkosh 2018</h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-2 border-gray rounded video-gallery-card\">\n  <a class=\"video-link\" href=\"../../resources/lecture-5-charts-and-airspace/index.html\">\n    <div class=\"inner-container\">\n      <div class=\"left-col\"><img class=\"thumbnail\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/Nts_8ZLIxwo/default.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"right-col\">\n        <h5 class=\"video-title\">Lecture 5: Charts and Airspace</h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-2 border-gray rounded video-gallery-card\">\n  <a class=\"video-link\" href=\"../../resources/lecture-6-the-flight-environment/index.html\">\n    <div class=\"inner-container\">\n      <div class=\"left-col\"><img class=\"thumbnail\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/shHvE6yV4IM/default.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"right-col\">\n        <h5 class=\"video-title\">Lecture 6: The Flight Environment</h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-2 border-gray rounded video-gallery-card\">\n  <a class=\"video-link\" href=\"../../resources/lecture-7-navigation/index.html\">\n    <div class=\"inner-container\">\n      <div class=\"left-col\"><img class=\"thumbnail\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/Th2N_rDfkDw/default.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"right-col\">\n        <h5 class=\"video-title\">Lecture 7: Navigation</h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-2 border-gray rounded video-gallery-card\">\n  <a class=\"video-link\" href=\"../../resources/lecture-8-helicopter-aerodynamics/index.html\">\n    <div class=\"inner-container\">\n      <div class=\"left-col\"><img class=\"thumbnail\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/OlQie93CwLY/default.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"right-col\">\n        <h5 class=\"video-title\">Lecture 8: Helicopter Aerodynamics</h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-2 border-gray rounded video-gallery-card\">\n  <a class=\"video-link\" href=\"../../resources/special-lecture-f-22-flight-controls/index.html\">\n    <div class=\"inner-container\">\n      <div class=\"left-col\"><img class=\"thumbnail\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/n068fel-W9I/default.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"right-col\">\n        <h5 class=\"video-title\">Special Lecture: F-22 Flight Controls</h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-2 border-gray rounded video-gallery-card\">\n  <a class=\"video-link\" href=\"../../resources/lec-9-meteorology/index.html\">\n    <div class=\"inner-container\">\n      <div class=\"left-col\"><img class=\"thumbnail\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/xPEqTH-c9Cc/default.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"right-col\">\n        <h5 class=\"video-title\">Lecture 9: Meteorology</h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-2 border-gray rounded video-gallery-card\">\n  <a class=\"video-link\" href=\"../../resources/lecture-10-communication-and-flight-information/index.html\">\n    <div class=\"inner-container\">\n      <div class=\"left-col\"><img class=\"thumbnail\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/alLh1Jdqwvg/default.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"right-col\">\n        <h5 class=\"video-title\">Lecture 10: Communication and Flight Information</h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-2 border-gray rounded video-gallery-card\">\n  <a class=\"video-link\" href=\"../../resources/lecture-11-aircraft-ownership-and-maintenance/index.html\">\n    <div class=\"inner-container\">\n      <div class=\"left-col\"><img class=\"thumbnail\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/MNIYBTHc6mg/default.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"right-col\">\n        <h5 class=\"video-title\">Lecture 11: Aircraft Ownership and Maintenance</h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-2 border-gray rounded video-gallery-card\">\n  <a class=\"video-link\" href=\"../../resources/special-lecture-the-how-and-the-why-of-ifr/index.html\">\n    <div class=\"inner-container\">\n      <div class=\"left-col\"><img class=\"thumbnail\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/6oZL2c3tgps/default.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"right-col\">\n        <h5 class=\"video-title\">Special Lecture: The How and the Why of IFR</h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-2 border-gray rounded video-gallery-card\">\n  <a class=\"video-link\" href=\"../../resources/lecture-12-aircraft-performance/index.html\">\n    <div class=\"inner-container\">\n      <div class=\"left-col\"><img class=\"thumbnail\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/3sB64Au76h0/default.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"right-col\">\n        <h5 class=\"video-title\">Lecture 12: Aircraft Performance</h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-2 border-gray rounded video-gallery-card\">\n  <a class=\"video-link\" href=\"../../resources/lecture-13-interpreting-weather-data/index.html\">\n    <div class=\"inner-container\">\n      <div class=\"left-col\"><img class=\"thumbnail\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/-dOX_4lI6HY/default.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"right-col\">\n        <h5 class=\"video-title\">Lecture 13:  Interpreting Weather Data</h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-2 border-gray rounded video-gallery-card\">\n  <a class=\"video-link\" href=\"../../resources/lecture-14-human-factors/index.html\">\n    <div class=\"inner-container\">\n      <div class=\"left-col\"><img class=\"thumbnail\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/RSuztJUlgOM/default.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"right-col\">\n        <h5 class=\"video-title\">Lecture 14: Human Factors</h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-2 border-gray rounded video-gallery-card\">\n  <a class=\"video-link\" href=\"../../resources/lecture-15-flight-planning/index.html\">\n    <div class=\"inner-container\">\n      <div class=\"left-col\"><img class=\"thumbnail\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/EvcoYJtoQVw/default.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"right-col\">\n        <h5 class=\"video-title\">Lecture 15: Flight Planning</h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-2 border-gray rounded video-gallery-card\">\n  <a class=\"video-link\" href=\"../../resources/lecture-16-seaplanes/index.html\">\n    <div class=\"inner-container\">\n      <div class=\"left-col\"><img class=\"thumbnail\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/xsO2Ip6eiaY/default.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"right-col\">\n        <h5 class=\"video-title\">Lecture 16: Seaplanes</h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-2 border-gray rounded video-gallery-card\">\n  <a class=\"video-link\" href=\"../../resources/lecture-17-small-uas-operations/index.html\">\n    <div class=\"inner-container\">\n      <div class=\"left-col\"><img class=\"thumbnail\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/geJHchWUYQk/default.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"right-col\">\n        <h5 class=\"video-title\">Lecture 17: Small UAS Operations</h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-2 border-gray rounded video-gallery-card\">\n  <a class=\"video-link\" href=\"../../resources/lecture-18-weight-and-balance/index.html\">\n    <div class=\"inner-container\">\n      <div class=\"left-col\"><img class=\"thumbnail\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/802a1jvk5Ck/default.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"right-col\">\n        <h5 class=\"video-title\">Lecture 18: Weight and Balance</h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-2 border-gray rounded video-gallery-card\">\n  <a class=\"video-link\" href=\"../../resources/lecture-19-multi-engine-and-jets/index.html\">\n    <div class=\"inner-container\">\n      <div class=\"left-col\"><img class=\"thumbnail\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/ksyY5wa5_50/default.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"right-col\">\n        <h5 class=\"video-title\">Lecture 19: Multi-Engine and Jets</h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-2 border-gray rounded video-gallery-card\">\n  <a class=\"video-link\" href=\"../../resources/lecture-20-flying-at-night/index.html\">\n    <div class=\"inner-container\">\n      <div class=\"left-col\"><img class=\"thumbnail\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/EuNXVy5-KgA/default.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"right-col\">\n        <h5 class=\"video-title\">Lecture 20: Flying at Night</h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-2 border-gray rounded video-gallery-card\">\n  <a class=\"video-link\" href=\"../../resources/lecture-21-weather-minimums-and-final-tips/index.html\">\n    <div class=\"inner-container\">\n      <div class=\"left-col\"><img class=\"thumbnail\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/kiCNa95DnnE/default.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"right-col\">\n        <h5 class=\"video-title\">Lecture 21: Weather Minimums and Final Tips</h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n\n",
